.* LICPREP: GO LICPGM option 5, the tasks before an install.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='LICPREP'.
:IMPORT NAME=CHKPRDOPT PNLGRP=QHSZCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=DSPSFWRSC PNLGRP=QHSVCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKLICINF PNLGRP=QHLZCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKSFWAGR PNLGRP=QHSZCMD.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAIN'.F16=System Main menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=LICPREP HELP=HLPLICPREP KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Prepare for Install
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD WRKSFWAGR' HELP=WRKSFWAGR.Work with software agreements
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD DSPSFWRSC' HELP=DSPSFWRSC.Display software resources
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD WRKLICINF' HELP=WRKLICINF.Work with license information
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD ?CHKPRDOPT' HELP=CHKPRDOPT.Check product options
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPLICPREP.Prepare for Install - Help
:P.Before an install: the software agreements already answered, what
is installed now, the license terms, and a check of a product's objects.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F16=System Main menu
:PD.Shows menu MAIN.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
